# Firebase service-account keys. Nothing in this repo needs one any more —
# triage moved to /inbox/, which authenticates as a person against
# firestore.rules instead of as the Admin SDK. These patterns stay as a guard:
# this repo is public, and a key downloaded into this folder by habit must not
# become a commit.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
serviceAccountKey.json
